UID:naxos-potamia-feast-of-agios-georgios-potamia-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270423
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270424
SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Georgios\, Potamia
LOCATION:Potamia\, Naxos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The green valley village of Potamia keeps St George's day (23 April\, or Easter Monday when the 23rd falls in Lent) with a liturgy and then free food and wine\, music and dancing in the square. A spring feast with the island still empty of tourists.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/naxos/#potamia-feast-of-agios-georgios-potamia
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/naxos/#potamia-feast-of-agios-georgios-potamia
END:VEVENT
