DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270622
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Triada (Holy Spirit Monday)\, Filoti
LOCATION:Filoti\, Naxos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Filoti's early-summer feast at the church of Agia Triada\, on Holy Spirit Monday: violins and laouta in the square\, food and wine and dancing until the early hours. A quieter preview of what the village does on 15 August.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/naxos/#filoti-panigiri-of-agia-triada-holy-spirit-monday-filoti
