BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:naxos-danakos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-at-fotodotis-danakos-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270805
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270807
SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration at Fotodotis\, Danakos
LOCATION:Danakos\, Naxos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The fortified Byzantine monastery of Fotodotis Christos above the tiny village of Danakos celebrates the Transfiguration on 6 August with the Metropolitan's liturgy and the blessing of the first grapes\, and Danakos holds a small\, warm panigiri with food and live music. Local listings also give Danakos a feast for Agios Panteleimon on 27 July\, so ask which night the village is actually cooking. Glinado\, Damarionas and Kourounochori keep Sotiros the same day.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/naxos/#danakos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-at-fotodotis-danakos
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/naxos/#danakos-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-at-fotodotis-danakos
END:VEVENT
